"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nWe arrived by ferry from our hotel.\n\nEven though it was early in the morning, there were quite a few people around.  \nThe weather was a bit hot and made it hard to walk around,  \nbut the wide-open view was so beautiful that we lingered there for a long time.\n\nWe had a relaxing time up on the cliff overlooking the sea.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"